      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KAIRANGA (6) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (26.00) at this track last time. Solid record here winning two races. Has ability and looks hard to stop. SAMPSON (1) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has been in the money the last five starts, the latest when third (25.67) at this track. Can feature again. JIMMY JAMS (3) turned in a moderate run last time when sixth at this track over 390m behind Federal Voodoo (22.79) in a Grade 5. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Should be about the money. SUNSET DREAMING (7) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
